<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Stores the memory requirements for different components (e.g. meshes, materials, animations) of an import. All sizes are in bytes. <formalpara><title>See also</title>

<para>Importer::GetMemoryRequirements() </para>
</formalpara>
</para>
</section>
